Que:- Pick any one public API from https://public-apis.io/ (for example, a movie or food API) and find an endpoint that returns a list of items. Paste the endpoint URL and describe what kind of data it returns (e.g., movies, recipes, etc.).


Ans:-

API: Cat Facts API

Endpoint URL:
https://catfact.ninja/facts

Description:
This endpoint returns a list of cat facts in JSON format. 
Each item contains a fact about cats, making it suitable for applications that display animal trivia or for practicing API integration.
